    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Aperture Dating Simulator isn't your average fan-made Portal game...</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in an alternate universe from the series that inspired it, APDS will introduce you to a new Aperture - one that seems a lot more... normal than the original. At first.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of a manufacturing employee thrust out of their element and into maintenance, where you'll meet 8 brand-new personality cores, each with their own special little quirks. From level-headed supervisor Miss Esther to hot-tempered sports fanatic Rob, there's plenty of new &quot;faces&quot; to get to know.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aperture Dating Simulator is <strong>fully voiced</strong> by a group of independent voice actors and programmed by a single developer. With <strong>18 endings</strong> to discover and <strong>more than 40 cutscenes</strong> to unlock, there's a lot this tropey little dating sim parody has to offer. Or so we hope.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What do you have to lose? Your dignity? If you're reading this, it's already gone.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Aperture Dating Simulator isn't your average fan-made Portal game...</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in an alternate universe from the series that inspired it, APDS will introduce you to a new Aperture - one that seems a lot more... normal than the original. At first.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of a manufacturing employee thrust out of their element and into maintenance, where you'll meet 8 brand-new personality cores, each with their own special little quirks. From level-headed supervisor Miss Esther to hot-tempered sports fanatic Rob, there's plenty of new &quot;faces&quot; to get to know.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aperture Dating Simulator is <strong>fully voiced</strong> by a group of independent voice actors and programmed by a single developer. With <strong>18 endings</strong> to discover and <strong>more than 40 cutscenes</strong> to unlock, there's a lot this tropey little dating sim parody has to offer. Or so we hope.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What do you have to lose? Your dignity? If you're reading this, it's already gone.</p>",
    "short_description": "After a missing employee leaves a maintenance position vacant, Aperture swoops you out of manufacturing to take his place. Will you stay true to your contract, or fall for your subordinates?",
